Kovil adapts source from the Tide 1.2.18 client-area theme by Namingo and
the FOSSBilling 0.8.9 project. Templates and settings were adapted to the
Kovil design and native browser controls. See LICENSE and LICENSE-MIT.

Tabler Icons by Paweł Kuna and contributors and Geist by Vercel and
basement.studio are included as local font subsets. Their license texts
are in assets/fonts/. The bundled telephone input and Punycode helper
carry their own license notices in assets/libs/.
